@startgantt
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
<style>
ganttDiagram {
  task { BackGroundColor #EDF2F8  LineColor #17365D  FontColor #17365D }
  milestone { BackGroundColor #1E7B45  LineColor #1E7B45  FontColor #1E7B45 }
  note { BackGroundColor #FFF6E0  LineColor #9C6500 }
}
</style>
printscale monthly
Project starts 2026-08-03
saturday are closed
sunday are closed
[Foundations & platform] lasts 60 days
[Identity & catalogue core] lasts 60 days
[Identity & catalogue core] starts 40 days after [Foundations & platform]'s start
[Cart, checkout & payments] lasts 60 days
[Cart, checkout & payments] starts 40 days after [Identity & catalogue core]'s start
[R0 Internal Alpha] happens at [Cart, checkout & payments]'s end
[Fulfilment & orders] lasts 60 days
[Fulfilment & orders] starts 40 days after [Cart, checkout & payments]'s start
[Finance core] lasts 40 days
[Finance core] starts 40 days after [Fulfilment & orders]'s start
[R1 Closed Beta] happens at [Finance core]'s end
[Returns, wallet & AI assistant] lasts 60 days
[Returns, wallet & AI assistant] starts 20 days after [Finance core]'s start
[Marketing, admin & risk] lasts 60 days
[Marketing, admin & risk] starts 40 days after [Returns, wallet & AI assistant]'s start
[Analytics & hardening] lasts 50 days
[Analytics & hardening] starts 40 days after [Marketing, admin & risk]'s start
[UAT & stabilisation] lasts 40 days
[UAT & stabilisation] starts 30 days after [Analytics & hardening]'s start
[R2 General Availability] happens at [UAT & stabilisation]'s end
@endgantt
